{"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2026, 10, 18]], "date-time": "2026-10-18T11:48:13Z", "timestamp": 1792324093979, "version": "4.4.0"}, "reference-count": 40, "publisher": "American Geophysical Union (AGU)", "issue": "9", "license": [{"start": {"date-parts": [[2026, 9, 7]], "date-time": "2026-09-07T00:00:00Z", "timestamp": 1788739200000}, "content-version": "am", "delay-in-days": 6, "URL": "http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, {"start": {"date-parts": [[2026, 9, 7]], "date-time": "2026-09-07T00:00:00Z", "timestamp": 1788739200000}, "content-version": "vor", "delay-in-days": 6, "URL": "http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/"}, {"start": {"date-parts": [[2026, 9, 1]], "date-time": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z", "timestamp": 1788220800000}, "content-version": "tdm", "delay-in-days": 0, "URL": "http://doi.wiley.com/10.1002/tdm_license_1.1"}], "funder": [{"DOI": "10.13039/100000001", "name": "National Science Foundation", "doi-asserted-by": "publisher", "award": ["PHY‐2027555"], "award-info": [{"award-number": ["PHY‐2027555"]}], "id": [{"id": "10.13039/100000001", "id-type": "DOI", "asserted-by": "publisher"}]}, {"DOI": "10.13039/100000104", "name": "National Aeronautics and Space Administration", "doi-asserted-by": "publisher", "award": ["80NSSC23M0192"], "award-info": [{"award-number": ["80NSSC23M0192"]}], "id": [{"id": "10.13039/100000104", "id-type": "DOI", "asserted-by": "publisher"}]}, {"DOI": "10.13039/100000104", "name": "National Aeronautics and Space Administration", "doi-asserted-by": "publisher", "award": ["80NSSC24K0144"], "award-info": [{"award-number": ["80NSSC24K0144"]}], "id": [{"id": "10.13039/100000104", "id-type": "DOI", "asserted-by": "publisher"}]}, {"DOI": "10.13039/100000104", "name": "National Aeronautics and Space Administration", "doi-asserted-by": "publisher", "award": ["80NSSC23K1409"], "award-info": [{"award-number": ["80NSSC23K1409"]}], "id": [{"id": "10.13039/100000104", "id-type": "DOI", "asserted-by": "publisher"}]}], "content-domain": {"domain": ["agupubs.onlinelibrary.wiley.com"], "crossmark-restriction": true}, "short-container-title": ["JGR Space Physics"], "published-print": {"date-parts": [[2026, 9]]}, "abstract": "<jats:title>Abstract</jats:title>\n                  <jats:p>We investigate the onset of magnetic reconnection in Earth's magnetotail using a coupled magnetohydrodynamic with embedded particle‐in‐cell (MHD‐EPIC) model, which self‐consistently links global magnetospheric dynamics to electron‐scale kinetic processes. Unlike standalone kinetic simulations with idealized boundary conditions, reconnection in this framework is driven by large‐scale magnetotail stretching and plasma convection. Simulations are performed in two spatial dimensions to enable a comprehensive study of grid convergence and the effects of various kinetic scaling factors and mass ratios. A systematic convergence study demonstrates that resolving the electron inertial length  with approximately 1.5 grid cells is required to achieve grid‐independent reconnection onset timing and current sheet structure. The current sheet thins to a universal thickness of  at onset, indicating that reconnection initiation is controlled by electron‐scale physics. In contrast, both ideal and Hall MHD simulations fail to converge, with reconnection properties remaining dependent on grid resolution. The results in this study establish quantitative criteria for resolving kinetic scales in global simulations and demonstrate that reconnection onset in the magnetotail is fundamentally governed by electron‐scale processes embedded within global dynamics.</jats:p>", "DOI": "10.1029/2026ja035547", "type": "journal-article", "created": {"date-parts": [[2026, 9, 7]], "date-time": "2026-09-07T07:37:26Z", "timestamp": 1788766646000}, "update-policy": "https://doi.org/10.1002/crossmark_policy", "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 0, "title": ["Modeling Kinetic Reconnection Onset in Global Magnetospheric Simulations"], "prefix": "10.1029", "volume": "131", "author": [{"ORCID": "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4704-0942", "authenticated-orcid": false, "given": "Talha", "family": "Arshad", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [{"name": "University of Michigan  Ann Arbor MI USA"}], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}, {"ORCID": "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7288-2805", "authenticated-orcid": false, "given": "Yuxi", "family": "Chen", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [{"name": "University of Michigan  Ann Arbor MI USA"}], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}, {"ORCID": "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-8459-2100", "authenticated-orcid": false, "given": "Gabor", "family": "Toth", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [{"name": "University of Michigan  Ann Arbor MI USA"}], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}], "member": "13", "published-online": {"date-parts": [[2026, 9, 7]]}, "reference": [{"key": "e_1_2_8_2_1", "doi-asserted-by": "publisher", "unstructured": "Arshad T.(2026).Data for the paper: Modeling kinetic reconnection onset in global magnetospheric simulations (Arshad+ 2026)[dataset].Zenodo.https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19629478", "DOI": "10.5281/zenodo.19629478"}, {"key": "e_1_2_8_3_1", "doi-asserted-by": "publisher", "DOI": "10.1016/j.cpc.2025.109806"}, {"key": "e_1_2_8_4_1", "doi-asserted-by": "publisher", "DOI": "10.1002/2013JA019354"}, {"key": "e_1_2_8_5_1", "doi-asserted-by": "publisher", "DOI": "10.1017/CBO9780511536151"}, {"key": "e_1_2_8_6_1", "doi-asserted-by": "publisher", "DOI": "10.1016/j.jcp.2019.02.032"}, {"key": "e_1_2_8_7_1", "doi-asserted-by": "publisher", "DOI": "10.3847/1538‐4357/ad6323"}, {"key": "e_1_2_8_8_1", "doi-asserted-by": "publisher", "DOI": "10.1016/j.cpc.2023.108714"}, {"key": "e_1_2_8_9_1", "doi-asserted-by": "publisher", "DOI": "10.1016/j.jcp.2014.03.009"}, {"key": "e_1_2_8_10_1", "doi-asserted-by": "publisher", "DOI": "10.1063/1.2164808"}, {"key": "e_1_2_8_11_1", "doi-asserted-by": "publisher", "DOI": 